# Scattered into Shadow (jeuno 61), the Castle Oztroja chest with the Beast Collar already held (Prog 4, Stage 7): nil,
# the chest's own script (a regular opening). An opened chest leaves for a while, so this side is its own flow.
lists CastleOztroja/Treasure_Chest/onTrade
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-134.5,24,-21 job=BST lvl=50
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
quest Jeuno.ScatteredIntoShadow accepted
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 4
charvar Quest[3][61]Stage 7
item BeastCollar
item OztrojaChestKey
login
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest
trade Treasure_Chest OztrojaChestKey x1     # the collar held: nil; the chest's own script opens it
tick 4500
